sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Android App<br/>(AuthVM / Application)
    participant VCR as Backend voiceAuth.ts<br/>(JWT required)
    participant DB as MongoDB<br/>user_tokens / push_tokens
    participant UAPI as Users API (AP)<br/>api-ap.vonage.com

    App->>VCR: POST /api/voice/auth/token {userId(E.164)}
    VCR->>VCR: PHONE_REGEX + ALLOWED check<br/>RateLimit token:IP 10 per min
    VCR->>VCR: create sysadmin JWT (exp 120s)
    VCR->>UAPI: POST /v1/users {name:e164}
    alt 201 Created / 409 exists
        Note over VCR,UAPI: continue normally (also on other errors)
    end
    VCR->>VCR: create InApp JWT (sub:e164, 24h)<br/>acl: sessions/conversations/rtc etc.
    VCR->>DB: user_tokens insert<br/>{tokenHash(first 16 of sha256), sessionId, deviceId}
    VCR-->>App: 200 {token, session_id, device_id}
    App->>App: saveVoiceToken + createSession(token)<br/>isSessionReady=true
    App->>VCR: POST /api/voice/register {userId, action:register}
    VCR->>DB: phone_users upsert<br/>{isInAppAvailable:true}
    VCR-->>App: 200 {isInAppAvailable:true}
    App->>App: when FCM onNewToken fires
    App->>VCR: POST /api/voice/push-token<br/>{userId, deviceId, pushToken}
    VCR->>DB: push_tokens upsert
    VCR-->>App: 200 {success:true}
    Note over App,VCR: on session drop / restart
    App->>VCR: POST /api/voice/reconnect {userId}
    VCR->>VCR: regenerate 24h JWT only (same ACL)<br/>(no DB write / no Users create)
    VCR-->>App: 200 {token, session_id, device_id}
    App->>App: initVoiceClientWithToken(newToken)
